{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GLFJdcKGusvLfstVBqBbD3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# daybook\n2\t\n3\tBackend of a small public work-journal site. Authors post short entries from anywhere\n4\tin the world; every post card shows a date, and the home feed lists posts newest first.\n5\t\n6\t- `journal.py` — `publish(entry, client_tz)` is called by the API handler with the post\n7\t  body and the IANA time zone the author's browser reports. `display_date(post, viewer_tz)`\n8\t  is what the post card renders. `feed()` is the home feed.\n9\t\n10\tRun tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c220608f-b262-4df6-846d-c7e5e2b20929","uuid":"d8a87485-7a6f-4fa1-97af-ce3220db44cb","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:10:09.214Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-TK4Z1f/README.md","content":"# daybook\n\nBackend of a small public work-journal site. Authors post short entries from anywhere\nin the world; every post card shows a date, and the home feed lists posts newest first.\n\n- `journal.py` — `publish(entry, client_tz)` is called by the API handler with the post\n  body and the IANA time zone the author's browser reports. `display_date(post, viewer_tz)`\n  is what the post card renders. `feed()` is the home feed.\n\nRun tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
